{"id":"staya","lemma":"стая","pos":"noun","rank":4812,"glosses":["flock, herd, pack, troop"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%8F.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%8F.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"стаи","plural":"стаи"},"examples":[{"text":"Высоко над головой пролетела стая птиц.","en":"A flock of birds flew high overhead.","words":[{"g":"high, aloft, high up"},{"g":"above, over"},null,null,null,{"g":"bird","l":"птица"}]},{"text":"На путешественника напала стая волков.","en":"A pack of wolves attacked the traveler.","words":[{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"to attack","l":"напасть"},null,{"g":"wolf","l":"волк"}]},{"text":"На Тома напала стая диких собак.","en":"Tom got attacked by a pack of wild dogs.","words":[{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"volume","l":"том"},{"g":"to attack","l":"напасть"},null,null,null]}]}